        3,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageoforangeville.com/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s first gristmill, built in 1823 by John Curtiss, powered early settlers and still marks the spot where High Street crosses the creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
