      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1888 the Illinois Central Railroad arrived, turning Orangeville into a commercial hub and sparking a building boom that produced the historic Musser and Wagner Buildings.",
